  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU4Dialogue: Support to Conflict Transformation in the South Caucasus and the Republic of Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU4Dialogue: Support to Conflict Transformation in the South Caucasus and the Republic of Moldova is implemented by the UNDP as a joint initiative of the EU and the UN. It is based on the strategic partnership between the EU and the UN. In support of effective multilateralism, it aligns fully with the &#x201c;One UN&#x201d; approach. It is funded by the EU Neighbourhood Instrument under the aegis of the EC DG NEAR. It supports the EU&#x2019;s role in conflict transformation and management.</narrative>
  </description>
